    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-5">Log Files</h2>
    <p>PromptLikho follows a standard procedure of using log files. These files log visitors when they visit websites.
        The information collected includes internet protocol (IP) addresses, browser type, Internet Service Provider
        (ISP), date and time stamp, referring/exit pages, and possibly the number of clicks. This data is not linked to
        any personally identifiable information.</p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-5">Cookies and Web Beacons</h2>
    <p>Like any other website, PromptLikho uses cookies. These cookies are used to store information including visitors'
